<title>INDIA: India produces 46,540 tonnes aluminium in December.</title>
<headline>India produces 46,540 tonnes aluminium in December.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 46,540 tonnes of aluminium in December 1996 against 45,390 tonnes in November, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The country produced 387,950 tonnes of aluminium during April-December 1996 compared to 384,104 tonnes in the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
<p>It said the state-run National Aluminium Company Ltd exported 24,225 tonnes of alumina and 5,209 tonnes of aluminium in December, 1996.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Installed   December,1996     Cumulative output</p>
<p>	    capacity    --------------    ----------------</p>
<p>	    (annual)	 Actual	   Apr-Dec 96   Apr-Dec 95</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> BALCO    100,000	  7,601	     68,657	68,896</p>
<p> INDAL    117,000	  3,950	     29,602	47,375</p>
<p> HINDALCO 210,000	 15,092	    120,496     128,262</p>
<p> NALCO    218,000	 17,903	    151,570     139,571</p>
<p> MALCO     25,000	  1,994	     17,625	   nil</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total    670,000	 46,540	    387,950     384,104</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes.</p>
